{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52304","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观此身意相，都由水火风。\n有生皆有灭，有始皆有终。\n气聚即爲我，气散即成空。\n一羣泊（项校「怕」）死汉，何以（张改「似」，项校「异」）叫（项校「叩」）头虫。\n（以上三首，张锡厚分爲五首，似未允。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}